# FORLORN HOPE: the map is open: the hearts can also be reached the castle
# way, not just up the tower. With the foes sent away (this checks the
# map, not the fighting), the demo player's castle plan walks it with real
# presses: a mason stones the spike pit and the next takes key 1 (keys stay
# counted for everyone); a mason turns to stone over the drop's mouth, and
# the next crosses on it, hops the meadow's outcrop, hole and mound,
# unlocks the gate, takes the key behind the idol on the courtyard's
# walkway, drops into hall 1, takes the key on its platform, unlocks door
# 2 and drops onto plate 4, where it turns to stone. A sapper then follows,
# crosses the bridge plate 4 raised, takes the key past the bloater's
# corridor, drops into the dungeon, unlocks the tower's west door, crosses
# the tower's landing and unlocks its east door into the heart chamber.
game forlorn
cheat start 1
cheat no_foes
cheat bot_route 1
expect bot_plans == 5
botuntil units >= 5 9000
botuntil x >= 1250 3000
expect phase == 1
expect units == 5
expect lost == 4
expect doors == 4
expect plate3 == 1
expect solid42084 == 1
expect bottom == 580
expect tile56116 == 11
expect tile56104 == 11
expect tile18074 == 11
expect tile30079 == 11
